<title>USA: Isolyser names Dan Lee as CFO.</title>
<headline>Isolyser names Dan Lee as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isolyser Company Inc said Tuesday it named Dan Lee as chief financial officer and senior vice president of finance and administration.</p>
<p>He was also named a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Lee replaces C. Fred Harlow, who resigned from the board pursuant to his previously announced retirement from full-time duties at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>Lee served as chief financial officer and chief operating officer for Microtek Medical Inc for over eight years.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
